### IntelliJ: Ignore everything by default ###
.idea/*

### Whitelist the shareable project configs ###
!.idea/runConfigurations/
!.idea/gradle.xml
!.idea/vcs.xml
!.idea/codeStyles/
!.idea/inspectionProfiles/
!.idea/encodings.xml
/.idea/inspectionProfiles/Project_Default.xml

### Regenerable module files ###
*.iml
**/*.iml